                            <comment id="15203889" author="vozerov" created="Mon, 21 Mar 2016 08:23:12 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Pavel,&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;We need to have synchronous version as well. Otherwise, API looks inconsistent. I understand, that there is no sync method in Java. But Java API is based on jcache spec. These is not jcache in .NET, so we&apos;d better to follow our existing approach when all operations have both sync and async versions.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Vladimir.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
